+//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// OPTIMIZATION NOTES
+// ==================
+// - On Vega to use 2 constants in a packed op, pass in as one AW2 or one AH2 'k.xy' and use as 'k.xx' and 'k.yy'.
+//   For example 'a.xy*k.xx+k.yy'.
